# Normalize line endings so the repo does not churn across platforms.
# Text files are stored as LF and checked out as LF, regardless of the OS.
* text=auto eol=lf

# PowerShell must stay LF: the .ps1 carries a UTF-8 BOM and is read by
# Windows PowerShell 5.1, which dislikes CRLF-converted copies of it.
*.ps1 text eol=lf

# Binary artifacts, if any ever land in the tree.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
*.tgz binary
